    "description": "# BA-6: Status Change Logging\n\n_Automatically capture every BA Status or Team Role change to an audit trail, so Ops can see who changed what, when, and why._\n\n### AUTOMATION\n\n* The prototype's Change Status action logs every BA Status or Team Role change\n\n* Captures: Changed (date/time), Field, From, To, Reason, Changed By\n* Writes each entry to the Role & Status Change Log related list (BA-7)\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* Not confirmed in the transcript — sourced from the prototype only\n\n* Treated as a straightforward extension of [BUILD-202 — Brand Ambassador: Object + Core Status](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693577680227/f/) (BA-1) and [BUILD-206 — Brand Ambassador: Termination Automation](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693578209162/f/) (BA-5), not separately negotiated in the meeting\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Provenance: BA-6 (Brand Ambassador Record User Stories doc).\n* Depends on the Role & Status Change Log related list (BA-7) existing to write into — see BUILD-208.\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* [Taryn doc BA-6 — Brand Ambassador Record User Stories](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MsJXwt3oY-DyQuAdMzNYlyPenKUQl7g8mHzMmeRaVHs/edit?tab=t.g64hrhse8pog)\n* Dependencies: [BUILD-202 — Brand Ambassador: Object + Core Status](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693577680227/f/), [BUILD-206 — Brand Ambassador: Termination Automation](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693578209162/f/)\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n* Created 2026-08-20 from Brand Ambassador record documentation review.\n\n",
